      "reason": "The transcript and model text do not articulate or demonstrate that the three-coin commission is applied before payment to allow bids above available coins. The model explicitly states the winner \"pays the bid, gains the lot, then receives a three-coin auction commission,\" which does not support the claimed exploit."
